Part 2 of 3 of one topic of the recording (0:00 – 10:00).
The topic: Отчёт — Сроки.
Write everything in Russian.

Transcript of this part, one line per sentence, "[time] speaker: text":
[0:10] Анна: Сроки.

List the concrete points said in this part: each advice, step, argument, fact, example, number, decision, objection and conclusion — one point each. A point is one short sentence in your own words that keeps the specifics (names, numbers, what exactly to do). Skip greetings, jokes and repeats.

Write a JSON object:
points — the points in the order they are said; each with time — the time of the line it comes from, as written in the transcript (m:ss), and text — the point.
